{"id":"n31738-1-5","stage":2,"title":"접하다 · 靠","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n31738-1-5-1","ko":"여행 간 곳은 어떤 곳이었어?","zh":"你去旅游的地方是哪里啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"여행","meaning":"旅行，旅游","explanation":"여행：旅行，旅游","readings":[{"term":"여행","audio":"/audio/b5d87b0a7b5d6b82f2a8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28026","senseId":"1","lemma":"여행","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"간","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"17","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"곳은","meaning":"地方，地区","explanation":"곳：地方，地区；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"곳","audio":"/audio/24875f860934407bb8fb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18661","senseId":"1","lemma":"곳","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어떤","meaning":"什么样的，怎么样的","explanation":"어떤：什么样的，怎么样的","readings":[{"term":"어떤","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17185","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"곳이었어?","meaning":"地方，地区","explanation":"곳：地方，地区；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"곳","audio":"/audio/24875f860934407bb8fb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18661","senseId":"1","lemma":"곳","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"b5d87b0a7b5d6b82","term":"여행","zh":"旅行，旅游","audio":"/audio/b5d87b0a7b5d6b82f2a8.mp3","entryId":"28026","definition":"离开家，去其他地区或国外游玩的行为。","pronunciation":["여행"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"消失不见。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"24875f860934407b","term":"곳","zh":"地方，地区","audio":"/audio/24875f860934407bb8fb.mp3","entryId":"18661","definition":"一个特定的地点或位置。","pronunciation":["곧"]},{"id":"a0307911a0fb4256","term":"어떤","zh":"什么样的，怎么样的","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3","entryId":"17185","definition":"用于询问人或事物的特征、内容、性格、性质、模样等。","pronunciation":["어떤"]}],"audio":"/audio/4faa19f0b44d379b6987.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n31738-1-5-2","ko":"집들이 산에 접해 있는 마을이었어.","zh":"是坐落在山边的村庄哦。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"집들이","meaning":"房子，窝，巢","explanation":"집：房子，窝，巢；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"1","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"산에","meaning":"山","explanation":"산：山；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"산","audio":"/audio/ab367eb9a60ab986cced.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20954","senseId":"1","lemma":"산","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"접해","meaning":"靠，临近","explanation":"접하다：靠，临近；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"접하다","audio":"/audio/2a9c0dc766d4468aff91.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31738","senseId":"1","lemma":"접하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있는","meaning":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","explanation":"있다：某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"3","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"마을이었어.","meaning":"村子，村庄","explanation":"마을：村子，村庄；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"마을","audio":"/audio/16a6e53889b32d5b72f4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61099","senseId":"1","lemma":"마을","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"房子，窝，巢","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"人或动物为了遮寒挡暑等，进里面生活而盖的建筑物。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"ab367eb9a60ab986","term":"산","zh":"山","audio":"/audio/ab367eb9a60ab986cced.mp3","entryId":"20954","definition":"比平地高耸出很多，大多有着树木、草、石头等的土地。","pronunciation":["산"]},{"id":"2a9c0dc766d4468a","term":"접하다","zh":"靠，临近","audio":"/audio/2a9c0dc766d4468aff91.mp3","entryId":"31738","definition":"贴着或相连。","pronunciation":["저파다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"16a6e53889b32d5b","term":"마을","zh":"村子，村庄","audio":"/audio/16a6e53889b32d5b72f4.mp3","entryId":"61099","definition":"多户人家聚集生活的地方。","pronunciation":["마을"]}],"audio":"/audio/4c612835604b1d7238b7.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.218,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=31738","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":74,"sequenceScore":2.0447,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["是坐落在山边的村庄哦。","你去旅游的地方是哪里啊？","送智秀什么生日礼物好？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你去旅游的地方是哪里啊？","送智秀什么生日礼物好？","是坐落在山边的村庄哦。"],"answer":2}]}
